  "question": {
    "text": "An organic compound weighing 500 mg , produced 220 mg of $\\mathrm{CO}_2$. on complete combustion. The percentage composition of carbon in the compound is _____ \\%. (nearest integer)<br />(Given molar mass in $\\mathrm{g} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}$ of $\\mathrm{C}: 12, \\mathrm{O}: 16$)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Organic compound $\\xrightarrow[\\Delta]{\\mathrm{CuO}} \\mathrm{CO}_2+\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}$<br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{CO}_2}=\\frac{220 \\times 10^{-3}}{44}=5 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{moles} \\\\ & \\mathrm{m}_{\\mathrm{C}}=5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 12\\end{aligned}$<br />$\\% \\mathrm{~m}$ carbon $=\\frac{5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 12}{500 \\times 10^{-3}} \\times 100=12 \\%$<br />Correct answer is $12$",
    "image": null
  },
